{"type":"message","id":"9cc1aebb","parentId":"d399bf24","timestamp":"2026-02-27T03:41:32.688Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Based on my analysis, I have enough context about the project. The key findings from the task description are:\n- Recommend ts-fsrs (TypeScript) or py-fsrs (Python) - the current project uses fsrs.js (JavaScript)\n- FSRS-6 is the latest version with 21 parameters- Current implementation has many bugs, UI is too simpleNow let me start the design phase. I'll delegate to design-agent with a clear task.","thinkingSignature":"fac3c33609a4ba6cd07dfa1ec7be4bb54786f20dca47f4db6137dc07d259831b"},{"type":"text","text":"根据已有信息和任务描述，我现在开始组织重构工作。\n\n**当前项目状态分析：**\n- 已集成官方 `fsrs.js` 库\n- 已有多牌组支持（decks 表）\n- 已有主题切换支持（settings 表）\n- 存在一些 bug，UI 较简单\n\n现在进入**设计阶段**，委托 design-agent 进行架构设计：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vfort4z7gbyw_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat > /tmp/design-task.md << 'EOF'\n# FSRS-Memory 重构 - 设计阶段任务\n\n## 背景\nsearch-agent 完成了 FSRS 深度调研，结论是：\n- 推荐使用 ts-fsrs (TypeScript) 或 py-fsrs (Python)\n- FSRS-6 是最新版本，有21个参数\n- 当前项目实现有很多 bug，UI 过于简单\n\n## 项目路径\n`/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/`\n\n## 当前架构\n```\nfsrs-memory/\n├── src/\n│   ├── fsrs.js        # FSRS 算法封装\n│   ├── scheduler.js   # 调度器\n│   └── storage.js     # SQLite 存储\n├── web/\n│   ├── server.js      # Express API\n│   ├── public/\n│   │   ├── index.html\n│   │   ├── styles.css\n│   │   └── app.js\n│   └── test/\n└── data/cards.db\n```\n\n## 任务\n\n### 1. 技术选型评估\n- 对比 ts-fsrs vs py-fsrs（考虑 Node.js 环境，推荐 ts-fsrs）\n- 评估当前 fsrs.js 实现的问题\n- 确定是否需要迁移到 ts-fsrs 或继续使用 fsrs.js\n\n### 2. 架构设计\n- 识别现有 bug 并提出修复方案\n- 设计更清晰的分层架构\n- 设计前端组件化结构\n\n### 3. 输出\n- 架构文档 (ARCHITECTURE.md)\n- 包含：技术选型、模块设计、API 设计、UI 改进方案\n\n## 重点\n- 不增加新功能，专注于修复 bug 和改进架构\n- 确保：完整 FSRS 算法、多牌组管理、主题切换 三个核心功能正常工作\nEOF\necho \"Design task created\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":12700,"output