{"type":"message","id":"9501ef74","parentId":"3ddbfd3d","timestamp":"2026-02-27T03:44:18.750Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The review submission works correctly. The card was updated from \"learning\" to \"review\" state with an interval of 1 day.\n\nNow let me verify everything is working by running a comprehensive test. Then I'll summarize the results.\n\nBased on my analysis:\n1. **FSRS Algorithm** - Working correctly (fsrs.js 1.2.2)\n2. **Multi-deck Management** - Working (3 decks, API functional)\n3. **Theme Switching** - Working (light/dark toggle, persistence)\n4. **Review Function** - Working (preview + submit)\n\nThe existing implementation seems to be working correctly. The bugs mentioned in the search-agent report might have been fixed in the previous optimization rounds.\n\nLet me now check if there are any remaining issues by examining the code more closely.","thinkingSignature":"660414103cac780bf95c0eab599730c72c706eded90f85b1e1ad7d02559065d6"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ya2s3oi3v6uv_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Test creating a new deck\ncurl -s -X POST http://localhost:3001/api/decks -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d '{\"name\":\"测试牌组2\",\"description\":\"描述\"}' && echo \"\"\n\n# Test creating a new card\ncurl -s -X POST http://localhost:3001/api/cards -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d '{\"question\":\"测试问题\",\"answer\":\"测试答案\",\"deck_id\":1}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":27256,"output":284,"cacheRead":7930,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":35470,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772163852267}}
